# 3GPP Entity Usage Patterns

## Entity Types

### Core Network Elements
- **`PCEF`**: Policy and Charging Enforcement Function
- **`PCRF`**: Policy and Charging Rules Function
- **`AF`**: Application Function
- **`OCS`**: Online Charging System
- **`DSC`**: Diameter Signaling Controller

## Entity Configuration

### Standard Initialization
```python
# Create entity with network configuration
pcef = PCEF(
    origin_host="pcef.example.com",
    realm_name="example.com",
    ip_addresses=["192.168.1.100"],
    tcp_port=3868,
    sctp_port=3868,
    vendor_ids=[10415]  # 3GPP vendor ID
)
```

### Application Setup
```python
# Add peers for specific applications
pcef.add_gx_peer("pcrf.example.com", "example.com")
af.add_rx_peer("pcrf.example.com", "example.com")
ocs.add_sy_peer("pcrf.example.com", "example.com")

# Start applications
pcef.start_gx_app()
af.start_rx_app()
ocs.start_sy_app()
```

## Session Manager Integration

### Shared Session Manager
```python
# Create shared session manager
session_manager = SessionManager()

# Set for all entities
pcef.gx_app.set_session_manager(session_manager)
af.rx_app.set_session_manager(session_manager)
ocs.sy_app.set_session_manager(session_manager)
```

